WEBVTT

00:17:28.329 --> 00:17:32.026
considered by the North American
Vexillological Association

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:35.449
as the worst city flag in North America.

00:17:36.179 --> 00:17:37.346
[Proud to be Pocatello]

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:39.926
(Laughter)

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:43.872
(Applause)

00:17:43.896 --> 00:17:45.047
Yeah.

00:17:45.071 --> 00:17:46.221
(Applause)

00:17:46.372 --> 00:17:48.877
That thing has a trademark
symbol on it, people.

00:17:48.901 --> 00:17:50.916
(Laughter)

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.628
That hurts me just to look at.

00:17:52.652 --> 00:17:53.802
(Laughter)

00:17:53.915 --> 00:17:55.836
Thank you so much for listening.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:18:01.942
(Applause)